flowchart LR
    I[Incoming Capsule] --> P{Predecessor restored?}
    P -- No --> Q[Pending / retryable rejection]
    Q --> W[WAL restores seals and closures]
    W --> R[Retry validation]
    P -- Yes --> V[Validate and process]
    V --> C{Crash or restart?}
    C -- Yes --> W
    C -- No --> O[Closed, Conflict, or Abandoned]
    R --> O
    O --> E[Hash-chained event]
